{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/11452-half-demons","id":11452,"title":"Half-Demons","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-11-15T11:52:39-08:00","id":11452,"title":"Half-Demons","content":"So, in the &quot;Little Monsters&quot; sidebar it states that half-Demon children have access to Embeds just like their demonic parent. I was relatively surprised about the candour of the sidebar, expecting something a bit more ambiguous, but it's refreshing. So, what do people think? Treat them as Stigmatics who can purchase Embeds at 2 or 3xp per?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/209-that-other-guy","name":"That Other Guy","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"702"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-15T12:26:03-08:00","id":11480,"title":"","content":"Well, the ambiguity is there for demon-demon children.<br /> <br /> I'd personally just give half-demons access to Embeds as if they were Demons with no Incarnation, and otherwise just treat them like mortals.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/508-sikker","name":"sikker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar508_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"101"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-15T12:34:51-08:00","id":11490,"title":"","content":"&quot; Embeds as if they were Demons with no Incarnation&quot; is there any differernce because of that?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/914-ryu","name":"Ryu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"330"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-15T13:00:37-08:00","id":11514,"title":"","content":"I'd treat them as Mortals with Unseen Sense (God Machine) and one Embed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-15T17:38:54-08:00","id":11727,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/11452-half-demons?p=11514#post11514\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd treat them as Mortals with Unseen Sense (God Machine) and one Embed.</div> </div> </div> </div>Wow, that's not very generous, and very very restrictive for what I assume you intend to be a minor template. Ghouls can learn fifth level disciplines, some possessed can take a nuke to the face and not get sunburnt, but that is almost as unimpressive as sleepwalker and wolfblooded, which aren't even templates but merits, but it's rare for merits to give access to supernatural powers in nwod. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-15T19:22:25-08:00","id":11790,"title":"","content":"Maybe he means 'at character generation'?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Revlid wrote:<br /> Yes, hollowing out your humanity to become an utterly utilitarian asura is the exact suggestion I would expect from you, Aiden.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/168-aiden","name":"Aiden","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1431"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-15T21:14:36-08:00","id":11866,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>StSword</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/11452-half-demons?p=11727#post11727\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ghouls can learn fifth level disciplines, some possessed can take a nuke to the face and not get sunburnt, but that is almost as unimpressive as sleepwalker and wolfblooded, which aren't even templates but merits, but it's rare for merits to give access to supernatural powers in nwod.</div> </div> </div> </div>To be fair, the real Mage equivalent of ghouls would be proximi, who were detailed in one of the Mage books (I think the one on either the Guardians of the Veil or the Silver Ladder).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>&quot;Seven deadly sins/Seven ways to win/Seven holy paths to hell/And your trip begins/Seven downward slopes/Seven bloodied hopes/Seven are your burning fires/Seven your desires&quot; \u2014 Iron Maiden,</i> Moonchild","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1122-the-grim-lich","name":"The Grim Lich","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-16T01:44:34-08:00","id":11963,"title":"","content":"In the Kickstarter comments thread Rose Bailey mentioned she'd treat them as Stigmatics who could learn Embeds, which I thought was a pretty cool idea. <a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition/comments\" target=\"_blank\">It's buried somewhere in here, for reference.</a><br /> <br /> I personally might restrict them to just accessing their Demon parent's Incarnation's favored Embeds at the non-favored cost (3xp). If they have TWO Demon parents, well... you pick one.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Cxuog44JenzbN7GaAyRqDO4DXce9VGv6ybaCv9yYsPk/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Simulacre: An Alternative Morality Stat for Prometheans</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/9523-the-alchemy-lab-homebrew-athanors\" target=\"_blank\">Homebrew Athanors</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/887-metamurpho","name":"Metamurpho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar887_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"228"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-16T07:56:13-08:00","id":12071,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Metamurpho</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/11452-half-demons?p=11963#post11963\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In the Kickstarter comments thread Rose Bailey mentioned she'd treat them as Stigmatics who could learn Embeds, which I thought was a pretty cool idea. <a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition/comments\" target=\"_blank\">It's buried somewhere in here, for reference.</a><br /> <br /> I personally might restrict them to just accessing their Demon parent's Incarnation's favored Embeds at the non-favored cost (3xp). If they have TWO Demon parents, well... you pick one.</div> </div> </div> </div>If they have two demon parents they are Super Special and the God-Machine focuses a vast amount of effort on getting them killed. To date none has survived.<br /> <br /> So if you <i>do</i> get a pure demon child... I think they get a bit more than that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/959-morkaischosen","name":"MorkaisChosen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"290"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-16T10:08:55-08:00","id":12142,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Metamurpho</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/11452-half-demons?p=11963#post11963\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I personally might restrict them to just accessing their Demon parent's Incarnation's favored Embeds at the non-favored cost (3xp).</div> </div> </div> </div>There is no non-favored cost, going by the listings.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-16T10:10:00-08:00","id":12143,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MorkaisChosen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/11452-half-demons?p=12071#post12071\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> If they have two demon parents they are Super Special and the God-Machine focuses a vast amount of effort on getting them killed. To date none has survived.<br /> <br /> So if you <i>do</i> get a pure demon child... I think they get a bit more than that.</div> </div> </div> </div>There's actually been a small discussion over on RPGnet, and a bit of fan-fluff in which the father of the pure-demon-born rushes around, saving the lives of infants in return for elements of their home life, constructing a Cover for his child that the G-M won't penetrate and blow up.<br /> <br /> Perhaps it has happened before: Perhaps the reason <span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Siddh\u0101rtha Gautama was kept hidden in his palace was not just to protect him form the existence of pain, but from those who would wish to destroy him for his birth...perhaps Mary's virginity was, in reality, an oddity in her Cover...</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">\u200bQuite simply, I suspect that a pure-born (my term for children of purely Unchained parents) who survives to puberty is destined for great things. Great things that always leave the status quo a casualty. There is no end to the plot hook.</span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":180,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","user":"Leliel","date":"is one of those worlds that leave a bad taste in my mouth. 11-16-2013, 01:11 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-16T10:29:22-08:00","id":12167,"title":"","content":"He might be Lucifer among the Demons.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Part-time table flipper.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/519-chairkicker","name":"ChairKicker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar519_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-16T16:15:24-08:00","id":12352,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leliel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/11452-half-demons?p=12143#post12143\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> There's actually been a small discussion over on RPGnet, and a bit of fan-fluff in which the father of the pure-demon-born rushes around, saving the lives of infants in return for elements of their home life, constructing a Cover for his child that the G-M won't penetrate and blow up.<br /> <br /> Perhaps it has happened before: Perhaps the reason <span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Siddh\u0101rtha Gautama was kept hidden in his palace was not just to protect him form the existence of pain, but from those who would wish to destroy him for his birth...perhaps Mary's virginity was, in reality, an oddity in her Cover...</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">\u200bQuite simply, I suspect that a pure-born (my term for children of purely Unchained parents) who survives to puberty is destined for great things. Great things that always leave the status quo a casualty. There is no end to the plot hook.</span></span></div> </div> </div> </div>Works for me! They're definitely in plot device land, and getting more than &quot;choice of two sets of Embeds to learn.&quot; ;-)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/959-morkaischosen","name":"MorkaisChosen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"290"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-16T22:04:46-08:00","id":12507,"title":"","content":"I'm pretty sure with the amount of effort the God Machine will put into stopping two demons from mating that the result probably heralds the end of the world.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1136-wolfgar","name":"Wolfgar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"646"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-16T22:17:26-08:00","id":12518,"title":"","content":"Are you sure on that? It might not be the end of the world. It just might be something along the lines of &quot;major damage to the God-Machine&quot;. After all, this is a thing that wants to preserve its own existence no matter what. It might be that a double-demonspawn is born with the capacity to erode Infrastructure with a touch, or can draw an Angel into Falling with a word \u2014 both of which would be things that, while not necessarily bad, are things the God-Machine would want to nuke from orbit just to be sure they never got out.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>&quot;Seven deadly sins/Seven ways to win/Seven holy paths to hell/And your trip begins/Seven downward slopes/Seven bloodied hopes/Seven are your burning fires/Seven your desires&quot; \u2014 Iron Maiden,</i> Moonchild","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1122-the-grim-lich","name":"The Grim Lich","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-16T22:43:01-08:00","id":12531,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aiden</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/11452-half-demons?p=11790#post11790\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Maybe he means 'at character generation'?</div> </div> </div> </div> Ah hadn't concidered that, that would make sense.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-16T23:01:42-08:00","id":12541,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MorkaisChosen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/11452-half-demons?p=12071#post12071\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> If they have two demon parents they are Super Special and the God-Machine focuses a vast amount of effort on getting them killed. To date none has survived.<br /> <br /> So if you <i>do</i> get a pure demon child... I think they get a bit more than that.</div> </div> </div> </div>I would imagine a pure demon child would have access to the full demon template and then some. Special Embeds and super Ciphers as well as some other perks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/116-epimetheus","name":"Epimetheus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1758"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-17T03:45:32-08:00","id":12639,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/11452-half-demons?p=12142#post12142\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There is no non-favored cost, going by the listings.</div> </div> </div> </div>You are correct! Derp on my part.<br /> <br /> That half-demon trying to save his kind... damn cool stuff.<br /> <br /> Also, I'm surprised the word &quot;nephilim&quot; hasn't been bandied about as a name for these oddities.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Cxuog44JenzbN7GaAyRqDO4DXce9VGv6ybaCv9yYsPk/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Simulacre: An Alternative Morality Stat for Prometheans</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/9523-the-alchemy-lab-homebrew-athanors\" target=\"_blank\">Homebrew Athanors</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/887-metamurpho","name":"Metamurpho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar887_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"228"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-17T04:30:45-08:00","id":12652,"title":"","content":"or even worse it is a way to either<br /> a.) create a new GM<br /> b.) create new angels / demons<br /> <br /> both of which are things the gm can't let happen......free angels/demons that can reproduce on their own would be like a self replicating virus, thus elimination at all costs","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/914-ryu","name":"Ryu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"330"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-17T05:06:30-08:00","id":12666,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Epimetheus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/11452-half-demons?p=12541#post12541\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I would imagine a pure demon child would have access to the full demon template and then some. Special Embeds and super Ciphers as well as some other perks.</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;And then some&quot; is accurate. It's plot device territory, and the question of whether it's &quot;ends the world&quot; or &quot;starts a new strain of purebred unfallen Unchained&quot; or &quot;destroys the God-Machine and takes its place&quot; is one for individual games...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/959-morkaischosen","name":"MorkaisChosen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"290"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-17T19:03:14-08:00","id":13117,"title":"","content":"Oh here's a thought, demons are capable of procreation, does that mean that angels can procreate too? And are half angels different from half demons? <br /> <br /> And yes this thread got me thinking about Preacher. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-17T21:49:40-08:00","id":13174,"title":"","content":"Demons can destroy a lot of Infrastructure, and Angels fall all the time; it's not that big of a deal. Such a being would be a priority, but not require such measures. No, the God Machine is pretty well enmeshed with humanity and the world, and is taking active measures to protect us as a whole if only for it's own selfish reasons. Something that can cause the kind of wide-scale damage that justifies that response would be catastrophic.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1136-wolfgar","name":"Wolfgar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"646"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-17T21:55:49-08:00","id":13179,"title":"","content":"Or it endangers its matrices OR its control over its servants.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/914-ryu","name":"Ryu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"330"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-18T03:40:26-08:00","id":13311,"title":"","content":"Hmm, here's a thought, what if such a child being born without a cover, it's the opposite? It doesn't have a cover because it's really born as a human? Perhaps it's even more than that, perhaps it's always in demon form because it's demon form and the human body it was born in are one and the same.<br /> <br /> A demon with an unbreakable cover and access to its full power at all times, I imagine that would provoke the god-machine's &quot;go nuclear&quot; response.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-18T04:04:16-08:00","id":13313,"title":"","content":"We theorized that the baby of two demons that survived would go through some kind of chrysalis and become a being that basically has all the powers and benefits of both angels and demons.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thread Reaper <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">\uff1c(\u00b4 \u055e)\u0a0a( \u055e )\uff1e\ufeff</span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/377-xanandithras","name":"Xanandithras","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar377_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"427"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}